<title>UK: CPR adds 200 million FFR to TEC-10 linked bond.</title>
<headline>CPR adds 200 million FFR to TEC-10 linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following TEC-10 linked domestic bond has been increased by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris, Paribas and Compagnie Parisien de Reescompte.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMPAGNIE PARISIEN DE REESCOMPTE.</p>
<p> AMT   *1.20 BLN FFR  BASE	 TEC-10    MATURITY    31.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -1.05 PCT PAY DATE    31.DC.96r</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  101.30    REOFFER    100.0     FULL FEES   1.70 PCT</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES     *LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY FOR 1.0 BILLION ON 09.DEC.96.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
